---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ServerFeature from "../components/ServerFeature.astro";
import ContactCta from "../components/ContactCta.astro";
import mostwantedKeyArt from "../brand/mostwanted/key-art.png";
import airfieldsKeyArt from "../brand/airfields/key-art.png";
---
<Base
  title="Servers · Xena Studios"
  description="MostWanted and Airfields: Xena Studios' own Minecraft servers, for Java and Bedrock. Both are in development."
>
  <PageHero kicker="Servers" title="Servers of our own.">
    Minecraft servers we design, build and run ourselves, for Java and Bedrock. Both are in development and not open
    yet: follow each one's site for news.
  </PageHero>

  <ServerFeature
    id="mostwanted"
    name="MostWanted"
    tagline="Cops vs. prisoners, on Java and Bedrock."
    keyArt={mostwantedKeyArt}
    keyArtAlt="The MOSTWANTED block wordmark over a pixel-art desert at sunset, blurred: mesas, cacti and a sand road under a low sun."
    status="In development, not open yet"
    address="play.mostwantedmc.com"
    site={{ href: "https://mostwantedmc.com", text: "mostwantedmc.com" }}
    links={[
      { href: "https://mostwantedmc.com/news", text: "News" },
      { href: "https://mostwantedmc.com/support", text: "Support" },
    ]}
  >
    <p>
      A Jailbreak-style server. Prisoners break out and rob the town; guards, picked by application, bring them back.
      One world that keeps running, with our own plugins for commands and chat.
    </p>
  </ServerFeature>

  <ServerFeature
    id="airfields"
    name="Airfields"
    tagline="Sky-mining PvP, on Java and Bedrock."
    keyArt={airfieldsKeyArt}
    keyArtAlt="The gold AIRFIELDS wordmark with snow piled on its letters, over pixel-art floating islands under a winter aurora."
    status="In development, not open yet"
    address="play.airfieldsmc.com"
    site={{ href: "https://airfieldsmc.com", text: "airfieldsmc.com" }}
    links={[
      { href: "https://airfieldsmc.com/news/airfields-is-coming", text: "Announcement" },
      { href: "https://airfieldsmc.com/support", text: "Support" },
    ]}
  >
    <p>
      Mine ore on frozen floating islands, sell it, and buy your way up the mines. Every island has its own ore mob and
      mini-boss; their shards and cores go into the forge for better gear, and better gear opens the next island.
    </p>
    <p>Above it all, the higher mines and KOTH go to whoever can take them. This season is winter.</p>
  </ServerFeature>

  <ContactCta idPrefix="servers-cta" />
</Base>
